# What `docker build .` from the repo root never sends to the builder. `.env` above
# all: an image must not carry the secrets - they arrive as environment variables.
.env
.git
.venv
.run
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
specs
# The frontend image builds these itself; a stale local copy must not stand in for them.
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
